---
const title = "猪猪小记编辑室 | Cochonnet Villa";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-Hans">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <link rel="icon" href="/assets/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
  </head>
  <body class="notes-studio">
    <div class="shell">
      <section class="masthead">
        <p class="eyebrow">猪猪小记 · 编辑室</p>
        <h1>写一篇随笔，保存后直接发布到网站。</h1>
        <p>
          发布会把 <code>content/notes.json</code> 提交到 GitHub，网站在 1–2 分钟后自动更新。
          正文使用标准 Markdown：空行分段、<code>## 小标题</code>、<code>- 列表</code>、<code>1. 有序列表</code>、
          <code>&gt; 引用</code>、<code>[链接](网址)</code>、<code>**加粗**</code>、<code>*斜体*</code> 和代码块。
          标记符号后要留一个空格；旧式 <code>##小标题</code> 会在保存时自动规范。原始 HTML 不会执行。
        </p>
        <div class="hero-links">
          <a class="button button-primary" href="/notes/">打开小记页面</a>
          <a class="button button-muted" href="/admin/">返回内容工作室</a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="layout">
        <div class="stack">
          <section class="card">
            <h2>登录（GitHub token）</h2>
            <p class="helper">
              和 <code>/admin/</code> 共用同一个 fine-grained token（需要
              <code>Contents: Read and write</code> 权限）。保存一次，两个编辑器都算登录。
            </p>
            <div style="margin-top: 1rem;">
              <label for="token-input">GitHub token</label>
              <input id="token-input" type="password" placeholder="粘贴 token 后点保存" autocomplete="off" />
            </div>
            <div class="token-actions" style="margin-top: 0.9rem;">
              <button class="button button-primary" id="save-token-button" type="button">保存 token</button>
              <button class="button button-muted" id="clear-token-button" type="button">清除 token</button>
            </div>
            <div class="status" id="auth-status">正在检查……</div>
          </section>

          <section class="card">
            <h2>小记列表</h2>
            <div class="token-actions" style="margin-top: 0.9rem;">
              <button class="button button-primary" id="new-note-button" type="button">写新的一篇</button>
              <button class="button button-muted" id="reload-button" type="button">重新读取</button>
            </div>
            <div class="note-list" id="notes-list"></div>
            <div class="status" id="list-status">正在读取……</div>
          </section>

          <section class="card">
            <h2>发布</h2>
            <div>
              <label for="commit-message-input">提交说明</label>
              <input id="commit-message-input" type="text" value="更新猪猪小记" />
            </div>
            <div class="token-actions" style="margin-top: 0.9rem;">
              <button class="button button-primary" id="publish-button" type="button">发布到 GitHub</button>
            </div>
            <div class="status" id="publish-status">列表和网站保持一致。</div>
          </section>
        </div>

        <div class="stack">
          <section class="card">
            <h2>编辑器</h2>
            <div class="field-grid">
              <div>
                <label for="title-input">标题</label>
                <input id="title-input" type="text" placeholder="今天想记点什么？" />
              </div>
              <div class="field-row">
                <div>
                  <label for="date-input">日期</label>
                  <input id="date-input" type="date" />
                </div>
                <div>
                  <label for="mood-input">心情（可选）</label>
                  <input id="mood-input" type="text" placeholder="🐷" maxlength="8" />
                </div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <label for="body-input">正文</label>
                <textarea id="body-input" spellcheck="false" placeholder="## 小标题\n\n正文使用标准 Markdown……"></textarea>
                <div class="status" id="markdown-status" aria-live="polite">
                  Markdown 格式正常；预览与正式页面使用同一套规则。
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="studio-actions" style="margin-top: 1rem;">
              <button class="button button-primary" id="save-note-button" type="button">收进列表</button>
              <button class="button button-muted" id="delete-note-button" type="button">清空重写</button>
              <button class="button button-muted" id="backup-draft-button" type="button">备份草稿</button>
            </div>
            <div class="status" id="editor-status">每次输入都会自动存进本浏览器，不怕误关页面。</div>
            <div class="status" id="draft-status">
              停笔 5 分钟自动把草稿（含未发布的列表修改）备份到仓库的 notes-drafts 分支，也可点「备份草稿」。换浏览器打开会自动恢复；发布成功后自动清空。
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="card">
            <h2>预览</h2>
            <div class="preview">
              <p class="preview-meta" id="preview-meta"></p>
              <h3 class="preview-title" id="preview-title">（还没有标题）</h3>
              <div class="preview-body note-body" id="preview-body"></div>
            </div>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>

<style is:global>
  :root {
    --paper: #fff8ef;
    --shell: rgba(255, 252, 246, 0.86);
    --ink: #4e2f33;
    --ink-soft: #71535d;
    --rose: #f8a6ba;
    --rose-deep: #d86b8d;
    --peach: #f5b57e;
    --line: rgba(120, 76, 78, 0.14);
    --shadow: 0 24px 80px rgba(104, 63, 45, 0.14);
  }

  * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  body.notes-studio {
    margin: 0;
    min-width: 320px;
    font-family: "Trebuchet MS", sans-serif;
    color: var(--ink);
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(248, 166, 186, 0.42), transparent 26%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 85% 12%, rgba(245, 181, 126, 0.3), transparent 22%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, #fffaf3 0%, #fff0dc 55%, #fffaf2 100%);
  }

  .notes-studio a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .notes-studio .shell {
    width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 1.25rem));
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 1rem 0 3rem;
  }

  .notes-studio .masthead,
  .notes-studio .card {
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 28px;
    background: var(--shell);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }

  .notes-studio .masthead {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }

  .notes-studio .eyebrow {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--rose-deep);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
  }

  .notes-studio h1,
  .notes-studio h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .notes-studio h1 {
    font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 4vw, 2.7rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
  }

  .notes-studio h2 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
  }

  .notes-studio p {
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .notes-studio .hero-links,
  .notes-studio .studio-actions,
  .notes-studio .token-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .notes-studio .button {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 2.7rem;
    padding: 0.7rem 1rem;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: white;
    color: var(--ink);
    font: inherit;
    font-weight: 700;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .notes-studio .button-primary {
    color: #fff9f6;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--rose-deep), #dd8b56);
    box-shadow: 0 14px 32px rgba(216, 107, 141, 0.28);
  }

  .notes-studio .button-muted {
    border-color: var(--line);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.76);
  }

  .notes-studio .layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(280px, 0.85fr) minmax(0, 1.15fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .notes-studio .stack {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .notes-studio .card {
    padding: 1.25rem;
  }

  .notes-studio label {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .notes-studio input,
  .notes-studio textarea {
    width: 100%;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
    color: var(--ink);
    font: inherit;
  }

  .notes-studio input {
    min-height: 2.9rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 0.9rem;
  }

  .notes-studio textarea {
    min-height: 18rem;
    padding: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    resize: vertical;
  }

  .notes-studio .field-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.9rem;
    margin-top: 0.9rem;
  }

  .notes-studio .field-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0.9rem;
  }

  .notes-studio .status {
    margin-top: 0.9rem;
    padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .notes-studio .status[data-tone="success"] {
    background: rgba(173, 199, 138, 0.22);
    color: #36512f;
  }

  .notes-studio .status[data-tone="warning"] {
    background: rgba(245, 181, 126, 0.22);
    color: #6f4a20;
  }

  .notes-studio .status[data-tone="error"] {
    background: rgba(216, 107, 141, 0.18);
    color: #762a44;
  }

  .notes-studio code {
    padding: 0.12rem 0.32rem;
    border-radius: 0.35rem;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.76);
  }

  .notes-studio .note-list {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.7rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .notes-studio .list-empty {
    padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
  }

  .notes-studio .note-item {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 18px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
  }

  .notes-studio .note-item.is-editing {
    border-color: var(--rose-deep);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 26px rgba(216, 107, 141, 0.18);
  }

  .notes-studio .note-item-meta {
    color: var(--rose-deep);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .notes-studio .note-item-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-top: 0.2rem;
  }

  .notes-studio .note-item-actions .button {
    min-height: 2.1rem;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.85rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .notes-studio .preview {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    padding: 1.1rem;
    border-radius: 18px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.78);
  }

  .notes-studio .preview-meta {
    min-height: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--rose-deep);
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .notes-studio .preview-title {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }

  .notes-studio .preview-body {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .notes-studio .preview-body p,
  .notes-studio .preview-body ul,
  .notes-studio .preview-body ol,
  .notes-studio .preview-body blockquote,
  .notes-studio .preview-body pre,
  .notes-studio .preview-body table {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .notes-studio .preview-body h1,
  .notes-studio .preview-body h2,
  .notes-studio .preview-body h3,
  .notes-studio .preview-body h4,
  .notes-studio .preview-body h5,
  .notes-studio .preview-body h6 {
    margin: 0.4rem 0 0;
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .notes-studio .preview-body h1,
  .notes-studio .preview-body h2 {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
  }

  .notes-studio .preview-body h3 {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }

  .notes-studio .preview-body h4,
  .notes-studio .preview-body h5,
  .notes-studio .preview-body h6 {
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .notes-studio .preview-body ul,
  .notes-studio .preview-body ol {
    padding-left: 1.3rem;
  }

  .notes-studio .preview-body a {
    color: var(--rose-deep);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 0.16em;
  }

  .notes-studio .preview-body blockquote {
    padding-left: 0.8rem;
    border-left: 3px solid rgba(216, 107, 141, 0.45);
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .notes-studio .preview-body pre {
    max-width: 100%;
    overflow-x: auto;
    padding: 0.8rem;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: rgba(78, 47, 51, 0.08);
  }

  .notes-studio .preview-body pre code {
    padding: 0;
    background: transparent;
  }

  .notes-studio .preview-body table {
    display: block;
    max-width: 100%;
    overflow-x: auto;
    border-collapse: collapse;
  }

  .notes-studio .preview-body th,
  .notes-studio .preview-body td {
    padding: 0.4rem 0.55rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    text-align: left;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .notes-studio .layout {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .notes-studio .button {
      width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>

<script>
  import { initNotesAdmin } from "../../notes-admin.js";

  initNotesAdmin();
</script>
